<title>USA: U.S EPA to hold Mar.18 hearing on Ariz. clean fuel.</title>
<headline>U.S EPA to hold Mar.18 hearing on Ariz. clean fuel.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) will hold a public meeting here on March 18 to discuss a date for mandating cleaner burning gasoline in  Phoenix, the agency announced Thursday.</p>
<p>The federal reformulated gasoline program (RFG) would allow the state of Arizona to require the cleaner fuel to help Phoenix cut down on smog-producing ozone, the agency said in a statement.</p>
<p>((David Brinkerhoff, Los Angeles bureau +1 213 380 2014))</p>
